{"id":"td-2001","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2024-08-31","tags":["拆解分析","问界"],"title":{"zh":"【车灯拆解2411】问界M9 尾灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"近期，小编收获问界M9高配大灯和尾灯一个，由于大灯带DLP拆解工作量比较大，小编先把尾灯拆了呈现给大家。小编手上的是个A灯，即侧围尾灯，这个灯主要功能是位置、刹车、转向和ISD交互","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"近期，小编收获问界M9高配大灯和尾灯一个，由于大灯带DLP拆解工作量比较大，小编先把尾灯拆了呈现给大家。小编手上的是个A灯，即侧围尾灯，这个灯主要功能是位置、刹车、转向和ISD交互。\n\n先分离壳体，现在干燥剂几乎快成了车灯的标配，只能说咱们国家的终端消费者还是比较苛刻的，不过十几块钱换消费者少投诉，想必主机厂也是算过账了。\n\n中间灯体主要分为两部分，信号灯部分和ISD交互屏部分。\n\n信号灯部分采用了两块厚壁，其中有一块是红色的，比较少见。ISD部分采用了一块驱动控制板和LED灯板，两块板是用软板连接，属于比较贵的方案了。\n\n这款尾灯ISD屏幕虽然像素数量不多，但所呈现出来的清晰度还是比较高的，没有什么串光。从结构上来讲，首先底部有一个底板，底板上方就是LED灯板了。灯板上方首先是双色内面罩，黑色+散色材料。再上方是一个镀铝支架，作用也是防串光。再外部又是一个双色内面罩，黑色+透明。所以这么算下来，一共有3层防串光的结构件，最后的效果想串光都难。\n\n最后，这款灯来自星宇。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/2001.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fr3oAiPBqWQ2qtsI92ONlS5J81TS.png","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FnC3EA4jjHL1GG-sp7CfvgG8-rpt.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fon-PGOkDd3ssODceaqkN8AY1wQ3.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fgm4zh8HmWidg1BKgjJ8j3jb8fZO.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FswSmyI-LeWNHVezEjxZAmzXa2Vz.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fvo0wKL-WhSN09QYncat7zomJrhJ.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FhwqHzpD8FeR_7T_rKm6srY19gc2.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FviilItDYV297KGN6EpysnpG3_6Q.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FowW_yUt-ByHNFQmeQzVQ-VFlRVA.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fi8tmYPbFtofR-RjqytFmL703pnd.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FiCgXmg2rm03CumkxpKyDrAlU_Yy.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlBhESYhxW6Ft3nRcBqLzt-4wNNZ.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlPWnqCVl9UwqYpoC-c0KCyw5LNa.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FuP4Fp3xlca4ekO3sdoRqzJ6BhU4.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlZ3Xmc6jwUQuhQnDNfB71ixWQQe.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlSItPeBhAfrAjwWu95dUMSlX6Je.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FjYW95XhMNujmXyrJP2R8l9Yo69k.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fjks9EqB0mVtm3d8JTsGXstYYR2w.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fh9H7WwGdYur6LF3W9VU8OmR-8DH.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FrQ6x0KaHmwAki3830HzyE5Aoo4L.jpg","https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FmpE3qsGX436sy8r0kDjBAe-BPaH.jpg"],"video":"","videos":[]},"full":true,"addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:25:12.121Z","content":[{"t":"text","v":"近期，小编收获问界M9高配大灯和尾灯一个，由于大灯带DLP拆解工作量比较大，小编先把尾灯拆了呈现给大家。小编手上的是个A灯，即侧围尾灯，这个灯主要功能是位置、刹车、转向和ISD交互。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fr3oAiPBqWQ2qtsI92ONlS5J81TS.png"},{"t":"text","v":"先分离壳体，现在干燥剂几乎快成了车灯的标配，只能说咱们国家的终端消费者还是比较苛刻的，不过十几块钱换消费者少投诉，想必主机厂也是算过账了。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FnC3EA4jjHL1GG-sp7CfvgG8-rpt.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"中间灯体主要分为两部分，信号灯部分和ISD交互屏部分。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fon-PGOkDd3ssODceaqkN8AY1wQ3.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fgm4zh8HmWidg1BKgjJ8j3jb8fZO.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FswSmyI-LeWNHVezEjxZAmzXa2Vz.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"信号灯部分采用了两块厚壁，其中有一块是红色的，比较少见。ISD部分采用了一块驱动控制板和LED灯板，两块板是用软板连接，属于比较贵的方案了。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fvo0wKL-WhSN09QYncat7zomJrhJ.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FhwqHzpD8FeR_7T_rKm6srY19gc2.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FviilItDYV297KGN6EpysnpG3_6Q.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"这款尾灯ISD屏幕虽然像素数量不多，但所呈现出来的清晰度还是比较高的，没有什么串光。从结构上来讲，首先底部有一个底板，底板上方就是LED灯板了。灯板上方首先是双色内面罩，黑色+散色材料。再上方是一个镀铝支架，作用也是防串光。再外部又是一个双色内面罩，黑色+透明。所以这么算下来，一共有3层防串光的结构件，最后的效果想串光都难。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FowW_yUt-ByHNFQmeQzVQ-VFlRVA.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fi8tmYPbFtofR-RjqytFmL703pnd.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FiCgXmg2rm03CumkxpKyDrAlU_Yy.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlBhESYhxW6Ft3nRcBqLzt-4wNNZ.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlPWnqCVl9UwqYpoC-c0KCyw5LNa.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FuP4Fp3xlca4ekO3sdoRqzJ6BhU4.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlZ3Xmc6jwUQuhQnDNfB71ixWQQe.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FlSItPeBhAfrAjwWu95dUMSlX6Je.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FjYW95XhMNujmXyrJP2R8l9Yo69k.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fjks9EqB0mVtm3d8JTsGXstYYR2w.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fh9H7WwGdYur6LF3W9VU8OmR-8DH.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FrQ6x0KaHmwAki3830HzyE5Aoo4L.jpg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/FmpE3qsGX436sy8r0kDjBAe-BPaH.jpg"},{"t":"text","v":"最后，这款灯来自星宇。"}],"coverImg":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240831/Fr3oAiPBqWQ2qtsI92ONlS5J81TS.png"}